abstract: >-
  A research programme about records, readings, operations, composition and retained information.
  UHL supplies operational geometry under named premises. SIH studies field regularity and
  concentration in specified models. IDA, VCC and other branches supply instruments, applications
  and empirical tests with explicit observation and intervention interfaces.
